          no explicit diffusion                   ln_traldf_OFF   =  F
          laplacian operator                      ln_traldf_lap   =  T
          iso-neutral Madec operator              ln_traldf_iso   =  T
             use the Method of Stab. Correction   ln_traldf_msc   =  T
          type of time-space variation            nn_aht_ijk_t    =           20
             lateral diffusive velocity (if cst)  rn_Ud           =    1.7999999999999999E-002  m/s
             lateral diffusive length   (if cst)  rn_Ld           =    200000.00000000000       m
       Eddy Induced Velocity (eiv) param.         ln_ldfeiv     =  F
       Apply a geothermal heating at ocean bottom   ln_trabbc     =  F
       type of geothermal flux                      nn_geoflx     =            2
           bottom boundary layer flag          ln_trabbl  =  F
       Apply relaxation   or not       ln_tradmp   =  F
